    "result": "## Summary\n\nThe bug has been fixed! The issue was in the `frai` CLI's `gate` command handler in `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`.\n\n**The Problem:** The action handler was only capturing positional arguments in the variadic `args` parameter, which doesn't preserve unknown options like `--ci` when using Commander.js.\n\n**The Solution:** Use `process.argv` directly to capture all arguments after the `gate` command, ensuring flags are preserved when passed through to the `frai-gate` CLI.\n\n**Verification:** \u2705 The command `frai gate init --ci` now correctly creates both:\n- `FRAI-SPEC.md` \n- `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`",
